#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: captchaapi.php
msgid "GDPR Cookieless CAPTCHA for WooCommerce & Forms - captchaapi.eu"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: captchaapi.php
msgid "https://captchaapi.eu/docs"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: captchaapi.php
msgid ""
"Cookieless, GDPR-friendly CAPTCHA hosted in the EU - a privacy-first "
"reCAPTCHA alternative. Protects login, registration, lost-password, "
"comments, WooCommerce, and the popular form plugins."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: captchaapi.php
msgid "captchaapi.eu"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: captchaapi.php
msgid "https://captchaapi.eu"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-captchaapi-assets.php:109
#: includes/class-captchaapi-assets.php:126
#: includes/class-captchaapi-assets.php:143
msgid "Verification is temporarily unavailable. Please try again."
msgstr "La verificación no está disponible temporalmente. Inténtalo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:65
msgid "Testing..."
msgstr "Probando..."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:66
msgid "Test failed."
msgstr "La prueba ha fallado."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:77
msgid "Not allowed."
msgstr "No permitido."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:84
msgid "Add a site key and a secret key first."
msgstr "Añade primero un site key y un secret key."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:90
msgid ""
"The keys look swapped: the site key should start with pk_ and the secret key "
"with sk_."
msgstr ""
"Las claves parecen intercambiadas: el site key debe empezar por pk_ y el "
"secret key por sk_."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:108
msgid ""
"Could not reach the service. Check the API base URL and that captchaapi.eu "
"is up."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo contactar con el servicio. Comprueba la API base URL y que "
"captchaapi.eu esté operativo."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:112
msgid "Connected. Your site key is valid."
msgstr "Conectado. Tu site key es válido."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:138
msgid "Site key not recognized. Check that you copied the site key correctly."
msgstr "Site key no reconocido. Comprueba que lo hayas copiado correctamente."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:140
msgid ""
"The site key is valid, but this site's domain is not in the project's "
"allowed domains."
msgstr ""
"El site key es válido, pero el dominio de este sitio no está entre los "
"dominios permitidos del proyecto."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:142
msgid "The free tier limit for this billing period has been reached."
msgstr ""
"Se ha alcanzado el límite del plan gratuito para este periodo de facturación."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:144
msgid "The account is suspended over billing."
msgstr "La cuenta está suspendida por motivos de facturación."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:146
msgid "The account is deactivated."
msgstr "La cuenta está desactivada."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:148
msgid "The project is inactive."
msgstr "El proyecto está inactivo."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:150
msgid "Too many requests right now. The site key is valid; try again shortly."
msgstr ""
"Demasiadas solicitudes en este momento. El site key es válido; inténtalo de "
"nuevo en breve."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:152
msgid "The service returned an unexpected response."
msgstr "El servicio devolvió una respuesta inesperada."

#. translators: %s: error code returned by the service.
#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:155
#, php-format
msgid "The service rejected the request (%s)."
msgstr "El servicio rechazó la solicitud (%s)."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:232
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:241
#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:282
#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:435
msgid "Get your free keys"
msgstr "Consigue tus claves gratis"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:266
msgid "Account keys"
msgstr "Claves de la cuenta"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:269
msgid "Site key"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:277
msgid ""
"The public site key from your project dashboard. Starts with pk_live_ and is "
"safe to expose in the page."
msgstr ""
"El site key público del panel de tu proyecto. Empieza por pk_live_ y se "
"puede mostrar sin problema en la página."

#. translators: %s: link to create a free account.
#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:281
#, php-format
msgid "Don't have one yet? %s."
msgstr "¿Aún no tienes una? %s."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:286
msgid "Currently set by the CAPTCHAAPI_SITE_KEY constant in wp-config.php."
msgstr ""
"Definido actualmente por la constante CAPTCHAAPI_SITE_KEY en wp-config.php."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:292
msgid "Secret key"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:296
msgid ""
"Set by the CAPTCHAAPI_SECRET_KEYS constant in wp-config.php. Clear the "
"constant to manage it here."
msgstr ""
"Definido por la constante CAPTCHAAPI_SECRET_KEYS en wp-config.php. Elimina "
"la constante para gestionarlo aquí."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:306
msgid "Keep this secret."
msgstr "Mantenlo en secreto."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:307
msgid ""
"It belongs on the server only. Never put it in templates, JavaScript, or any "
"public code. Anyone who has it can forge verifications."
msgstr ""
"Solo debe estar en el servidor. Nunca lo pongas en plantillas, JavaScript ni "
"en código público. Cualquiera que lo tenga puede falsificar verificaciones."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:310
msgid ""
"Starts with sk_live_. During a key rotation, enter both keys separated by a "
"comma."
msgstr ""
"Empieza por sk_live_. Durante una rotación de claves, introduce ambas "
"separadas por una coma."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:311
msgid ""
"For a stricter setup, define CAPTCHAAPI_SECRET_KEYS in wp-config.php instead "
"and leave this blank."
msgstr ""
"Para una configuración más estricta, define CAPTCHAAPI_SECRET_KEYS en wp-"
"config.php y deja este campo vacío."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:317
#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:319
msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "Probar conexión"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:322
msgid ""
"Checks that captchaapi.eu is reachable and your site key is valid. Save your "
"keys first."
msgstr ""
"Comprueba que captchaapi.eu sea accesible y que tu site key sea válido. "
"Guarda primero las claves."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:328
#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:331
msgid "Protected forms"
msgstr "Formularios protegidos"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:335
msgid "Login"
msgstr "Acceso"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:336
msgid "Registration"
msgstr "Registro"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:337
msgid "Lost password"
msgstr "Recuperación de contraseña"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:338
msgid "Comments"
msgstr "Comentarios"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:345
msgid "WooCommerce checkout"
msgstr "Pago de WooCommerce"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:369
msgid ""
"WooCommerce login, registration, and lost-password forms follow the matching "
"options above."
msgstr ""
"Los formularios de acceso, registro y recuperación de contraseña de "
"WooCommerce siguen las opciones correspondientes de arriba."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:377
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Comportamiento"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:380
msgid "Failsafe mode"
msgstr "Modo a prueba de fallos"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:385
msgid "Let submissions through when captchaapi.eu is unreachable"
msgstr "Permitir los envíos cuando captchaapi.eu no esté disponible"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:388
msgid ""
"During an outage the verify request cannot reach captchaapi.eu, so strict "
"mode would block every form. With this on, forms stay usable and protection "
"resumes automatically once the service is back. Leave off for strict, fail-"
"closed protection."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:395
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avanzado"

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:398
msgid "API base URL"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:405
msgid "Leave as the default unless you self-host or proxy the API."
msgstr ""
"Déjalo con el valor predeterminado salvo que alojes tú mismo la API o la "
"sirvas a través de un proxy."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:422
msgid "Keys are set. Your selected forms are protected."
msgstr ""
"Las claves están configuradas. Los formularios seleccionados están "
"protegidos."

#: includes/class-captchaapi-settings.php:433
msgid ""
"No keys yet, so no forms are protected. Create a free account to get your "
"site key and secret key, then paste them in below."
msgstr ""
"Aún no hay claves, así que ningún formulario está protegido. Crea una cuenta "
"gratuita para obtener tu site key y secret key, y pégalas abajo."

#: includes/integrations/class-captchaapi-core-forms.php:108
msgid "Comment blocked"
msgstr "Comentario bloqueado"

#: includes/integrations/class-captchaapi-core-forms.php:132
#: includes/integrations/class-captchaapi-elementor-forms.php:61
#: includes/integrations/class-captchaapi-fluent-forms.php:77
#: includes/integrations/class-captchaapi-formidable.php:57
#: includes/integrations/class-captchaapi-forminator.php:61
#: includes/integrations/class-captchaapi-woocommerce.php:93
#: includes/integrations/class-captchaapi-wpforms.php:61
msgid "Captcha verification failed. Reload the page and try again."
msgstr ""
"La verificación del captcha ha fallado. Recarga la página e inténtalo de "
"nuevo."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Privacy-first proof-of-work CAPTCHA. Protects the login, registration, "
#~ "lost-password, and comment forms, plus Contact Form 7. EU-hosted, no "
#~ "cookies, no tracking."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "CAPTCHA basada en proof-of-work y centrada en la privacidad. Protege los "
#~ "formularios de acceso, registro, recuperación de contraseña y "
#~ "comentarios, además de Contact Form 7. Alojada en la UE, sin cookies ni "
#~ "seguimiento."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "During an outage the widget cannot produce an attestation, so strict mode "
#~ "would block every form. With this on, forms stay usable and protection "
#~ "resumes automatically once the service is back. Leave off for strict, "
#~ "fail-closed protection."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Durante una caída el widget no puede generar una atestación, por lo que "
#~ "el modo estricto bloquearía todos los formularios. Con esta opción "
#~ "activada, los formularios siguen funcionando y la protección se reanuda "
#~ "automáticamente cuando el servicio vuelve. Déjala desactivada para una "
#~ "protección estricta que bloquea ante fallos."
